  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is kinda serious matters. \nSometimes we accidentally clicked unfriend button, so my suggestion is we need to make an optional button like (yes/no) and it will pop out after we click the unfriend button, or maybe we can put a third optional button after we click the \"yes\" button if we intentionally want to unfriend them, and the button will say \"Are you sure about that?\"",
